# 全部克隆

If user says **全部克隆** · **换机** · **新电脑** · **新 Agent 接手**:

Execute Hub playbook: https://github.com/dymusiques/danying-apps/blob/main/全部克隆.md

Run clone script from hub: `bash ~/danying-apps/scripts/clone-all.sh`

Then this repo SETUP.md §1–5, then **`bash scripts/new-machine-bootstrap.sh`** (writes daily background config + verify + autopilot). Only OAuth/MCP and first `process-launcher start` may need Owner in Terminal.
